# The devkit is committed on this branch for reference (the bridge source is
# what documents the topic names and QoS our nodes match), but the base image
# already ships it built at /home/autodrive_devkit and the rules forbid
# modifying it. Keeping it out of the build context makes that structural
# rather than a promise -- no COPY can pick it up by accident.
devkit_ws/src/autodrive_devkit/

devkit_ws/build/
devkit_ws/install/
devkit_ws/log/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
.git/
